SUMMARY:Hills and More!
DESCRIPTION:These Boots Are Made for Hiking\nMEETUP POINT: 300 kingston Rd
 \, Pickering\n\nSo we are doing an extended hike after all your hill worko
 ut! Add an addtional 12km to the hill workout in the\nsame park. Focusing 
 on building cardio\, calf muscles and stamina.\n\nThis is your time to bri
 ng it on!\nJust for fun you could bring a loaded backpack!\n\nDon't forget
  to bring plenty of water\, snacks and good footwear. This is tick season 
 folks so it is highly recommended to wear long pants and shirts and spray 
 yourself with deet!
